  "concurrency_max": 5,
  "segment_count": 11,
  "total_duration_ms": 118272,
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-001a",
      "text": "太阳风停止后，地球不会在同一秒变天，已经离开太阳的最后一批带电粒子还要继续飞过来；",
      "parent_segment_id": "seg-001",
      "split_depth": 1,
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-001a.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "37d6b6574af8af3bd470bc1fcfb20f6bf9a9c0c23ce3aefe606b627c5216c276",
      "duration_ms": 7560,
      "request_id": "87f614e1-8ab9-4e52-9d5b-1f15ccc24435",
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-001b",
      "text": "几天后，这股持续冲击真的断掉，极地上空平时由太阳风不断补充能量的极光开始明显减少，地球外层也不再一直承受同样的粒子压力。",
      "parent_segment_id": "seg-001",
      "split_depth": 1,
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-001b.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "58de91aa4053b10aa2063082b88547d75e76bca00f8ba9647f37d105e26d816d",
      "duration_ms": 10680,
      "request_id": "19425ce3-84fa-4406-b90d-8effef5f2071",
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-002",
      "order": 3,
      "text": "磁层会向新的外部环境慢慢调整，许多由高速太阳风和持续磁场变化带来的日常空间天气变得更安静，卫星和电网少遇到这类持续背景造成的扰动。",
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-002.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b6f8b74ab5e1deeaad47b0b83b2557d90a5511d0999d70fec1f94df822f6b702",
      "duration_ms": 11160,
      "request_id": "3615713a-13d5-4cb7-a26a-2899e5331552"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-003",
      "order": 4,
      "text": "可太阳并没有被关掉，太阳光照常到达地球，而且契约也没有让所有日冕物质抛射一起消失，所以偶发的大团太阳等离子体仍可能冲过来，短时间重新点亮极光并搅动磁层。",
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-003.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0028a2c28b0504e5daef1d5c75160b4f789a6159cc99c0dee64065bddacdbde0",
      "duration_ms": 13608,
      "request_id": "bf05d2da-bdab-43c8-8568-2a1ec7c4c92d"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-004a",
      "text": "真正更大的变化在更远处，太阳风原本不断向外吹，在太阳系周围撑起一片巨大的磁化等离子体区域；",
      "parent_segment_id": "seg-004",
      "split_depth": 1,
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-004a.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e51ae1005baac422e4fed4e720b2e3d528aa86565504d6f2ff363c6dad8f4230",
      "duration_ms": 8424,
      "request_id": "5291ef22-d67e-4272-9bb8-ff25bf18c271",
      "order": 5
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-004b",
      "text": "没有新的太阳风补进来，这个日球层不会瞬间消失，却会随着旧的粒子继续远去而逐步缩小、重新寻找边界。",
      "parent_segment_id": "seg-004",
      "split_depth": 1,
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-004b.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b124d2328b7496045f7df2d8a0e709d53e54e915ef2cb552254361dbaf3a3afa",
      "duration_ms": 8568,
      "request_id": "978d37c1-3707-4c81-a76a-d5d1d04cb6c7",
      "order": 6
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-005",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "这层环境原本会挡掉和改变一部分从银河系飞来的高能宇宙线，它变弱以后，更多银河宇宙线可以进入内太阳系，深空里的辐射条件会一点点变得比今天严苛。",
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-005.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f5772665f83d95a81c70f577ffced68d5895bd9f0b918916d8c7d83a16ece7f8",
      "duration_ms": 11712,
      "request_id": "dfa08db4-7184-4612-af81-b754e3605c10"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-006",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "地球表面并不会因此马上成为辐射灾区，因为地球自己的磁场和厚重大气还在，真正先需要重新算风险的是长时间飞在地球保护之外的宇航员、月球和火星任务，以及怕高能粒子的航天器电子设备。",
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-006.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "aa700dcc8d2a7f71b4d0601e9ac34de99f93ef52f73febf91659896f989c6830",
      "duration_ms": 13992,
      "request_id": "44ef48c7-e588-47c6-babe-cffd9ae9e69e"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-007",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "连彗星也会留下变化，太阳风原本会拉扯它周围的带电气体，持续太阳风停止后，离子尾的形态会改变，可太阳光仍会加热彗星，尘埃和尘埃尾不会跟着一起消失。",
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-007.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b56dcf8739fb12232fc70661159b235170e9694719b6678a3ce12d7a79c7be3b",
      "duration_ms": 12936,
      "request_id": "903c2869-b35a-4781-8399-60b51b54461b"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-008a",
      "text": "最后留下的太阳系仍有阳光、行星轨道和地球的昼夜，只是行星际空间少了那股永不停歇的太阳风：地球附近平时更安静，",
      "parent_segment_id": "seg-008",
      "split_depth": 1,
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-008a.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "60174f673df44a87dd8e800665db4b78b7f1fc9351ed18738f3961e0afc11127",
      "duration_ms": 9648,
      "request_id": "92b7b6fe-81d8-4fdc-b152-0c980a95b009",
      "order": 10
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg-008b",
      "text": "极光更少，而远离地球以后，逐渐减弱的日球层保护让深空面对更多银河宇宙线，偶发太阳爆发仍能突然打破这份安静。\n",
      "parent_segment_id": "seg-008",
      "split_depth": 1,
      "audio_path": "runs/real-v2-daily-20260812-001/video-production/narration/audio/seg-008b.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c3daf51da799367a97f089f4256c52797f92f04e767000247a52893042021fe4",
      "duration_ms": 9984,
      "request_id": "60b67269-d26d-41d0-a5d8-8b0618f2799e",
      "order": 11
    }
  ],
